{% comment %}
  Orderbekräftelse (dk) — brandad för bæverbutiken.dk.
  Klistras in i: Indstillinger → Notifikationer → Kundenotifikationer → Ordrebekræftelse → Rediger kode.
  Innehåll enligt "custom order confirmation"-upplägget: tidslinje, grundarhälsning,
  FAQ, kontakt och nyhetsbrevs-block med rabattkrok.
  Fakta hämtade ur bæverbutiken.dk:s egna sidor (fragtinformation, retur-og-fortrydelsesret,
  handelsbetingelser, kontakt) 2026-08-23: INGA leveransdagar anges — sajten hänvisar
  konsekvent till att tiden visas i kassan. Skriv därför aldrig in svenska dagssiffror
  (0–2 / 1–2 / 5–10 arbetsdagar) här. Retur = 14 dages fortrydelsesret (forbrugeraftaleloven),
  ingen separat 30-dagars returpolicy är bekräftad för DK. Ändras policyn, ändra här.
{% endcomment %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="da">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Tak for din ordre</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f2f2f2; -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;">

  <div style="display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all;">
    Din ordre er modtaget — her er, hvad der sker nu, trin for trin.
  </div>

  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px; width:100%; background-color:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e8e8e1;">

          <!-- Sidhuvud -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="background-color:#000000; padding:20px 24px;">
              <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="text-decoration:none;">
                <span style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:26px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#ffffff; text-transform:uppercase;">{{ shop.name }}</span>
              </a>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Rubrik -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:36px 32px 8px 32px;" align="center">
              <span style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:30px; line-height:1.15; color:#000000; text-transform:uppercase;">Tak for din ordre!</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:8px 32px 4px 32px;" align="center">
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#000000; margin:0;">
                {% if customer.first_name %}Hej {{ customer.first_name }}!{% else %}Hej!{% endif %}
                Vi har modtaget ordre <strong>{{ name }}</strong>. Herunder kan du se præcis, hvad der sker nu.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Knapp: ordersida -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:24px 32px 8px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" bgcolor="#dd1d1d" style="background-color:#dd1d1d;">
                    <a href="{{ order_status_url }}" target="_blank"
                       style="display:inline-block; padding:16px 44px; font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:18px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; text-transform:uppercase;">
                      Følg din ordre
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Vad händer nu — tidslinje -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:28px 32px 8px 32px;">
              <span style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#000000; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Hvad sker der nu?</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:4px 32px 20px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td width="34" valign="top" style="padding:8px 0;">
                    <div style="width:24px; height:24px; background:#dd1d1d; color:#ffffff; text-align:center; line-height:24px; font-family:'Anton',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px;">1</div>
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:8px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000;">
                    <strong>Vi behandler og pakker din ordre</strong> — hurtigst muligt.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td width="34" valign="top" style="padding:8px 0;">
                    <div style="width:24px; height:24px; background:#dd1d1d; color:#ffffff; text-align:center; line-height:24px; font-family:'Anton',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px;">2</div>
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:8px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000;">
                    <strong>Pakken sendes</strong> — du får en e-mail med sporingslink med det samme. Kan du ikke finde den, så tjek din spammappe.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td width="34" valign="top" style="padding:8px 0;">
                    <div style="width:24px; height:24px; background:#dd1d1d; color:#ffffff; text-align:center; line-height:24px; font-family:'Anton',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px;">3</div>
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:8px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000;">
                    <strong>Fremme hos dig</strong> — den forventede leveringstid vises i kassen, inden du gennemfører dit køb. Altid sporbart.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Avdelare -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px;"><div style="border-top:1px solid #e8e8e1; font-size:0; line-height:0;">&nbsp;</div></td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Ordersammanfattning -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:24px 32px 8px 32px;">
              <span style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#000000; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Din ordre</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px 8px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                {% for line in subtotal_line_items %}
                <tr>
                  <td width="72" style="padding:10px 0; vertical-align:middle;">
                    {% if line.image %}
                      <img src="{{ line | img_url: 'compact_cropped' }}" alt="{{ line.title | escape }}" width="60" height="60" style="display:block; border:1px solid #e8e8e1;">
                    {% endif %}
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:10px 0 10px 12px; vertical-align:middle;">
                    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#000000; margin:0; font-weight:bold;">{{ line.title }}</p>
                    {% if line.variant_title and line.variant_title != 'Default Title' %}
                      <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#6b6b6b; margin:2px 0 0 0;">{{ line.variant_title }}</p>
                    {% endif %}
                    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#6b6b6b; margin:2px 0 0 0;">Antal: {{ line.quantity }}</p>
                  </td>
                  <td align="right" style="padding:10px 0; vertical-align:middle; white-space:nowrap;">
                    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#000000; margin:0;">{{ line.final_line_price | money }}</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Summering -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px 24px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-top:1px solid #e8e8e1;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:12px 0 2px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#6b6b6b;">Subtotal</td>
                  <td align="right" style="padding:12px 0 2px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#000000;">{{ subtotal_price | money }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% if discounts %}
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#6b6b6b;">Rabat</td>
                  <td align="right" style="padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#dd1d1d;">{{ discounts_savings | money }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endif %}
                {% for shipping_line in shipping_lines %}
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#6b6b6b;">Fragt ({{ shipping_line.title }})</td>
                  <td align="right" style="padding:2px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#000000;">{{ shipping_line.price | money }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:8px 0 0 0; font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#000000; text-transform:uppercase;">I alt</td>
                  <td align="right" style="padding:8px 0 0 0; font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#000000;">{{ total_price | money }}</td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Leveransadress -->
          {% if shipping_address %}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px;"><div style="border-top:1px solid #e8e8e1; font-size:0; line-height:0;">&nbsp;</div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:20px 32px 20px 32px;">
              <span style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#000000; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Leveres til</span>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#000000; margin:8px 0 0 0;">
                {{ shipping_address.name }}<br>
                {{ shipping_address.address1 }}{% if shipping_address.address2 != blank %}, {{ shipping_address.address2 }}{% endif %}<br>
                {{ shipping_address.zip }} {{ shipping_address.city }}
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endif %}

          <!-- Grundarhälsning -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f7f7f7; border-left:4px solid #dd1d1d;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:18px 20px;">
                    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#000000; margin:0; font-style:italic;">
                      "Tak for din bestilling! Hvis noget er forkert eller virker uklart, så skriv til <a href="mailto:{{ shop.email }}" style="color:#dd1d1d;">{{ shop.email }}</a> — så kigger jeg personligt på det."
                    </p>
                    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#6b6b6b; margin:8px 0 0 0;">— Axel, grundlægger</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- FAQ -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:28px 32px 8px 32px;">
              <span style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#000000; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Ofte stillede spørgsmål</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px 24px 32px;">
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000; margin:10px 0 0 0;"><strong>Hvornår sendes min ordre?</strong></p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b6b6b; margin:2px 0 0 0;">Vi behandler ordren hurtigst muligt. Når den sendes, får du en e-mail med sporingslink.</p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000; margin:12px 0 0 0;"><strong>Hvor lang er leveringstiden?</strong></p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b6b6b; margin:2px 0 0 0;">Den forventede leveringstid vises i kassen, inden du gennemfører dit køb. Fragten er altid sporbar.</p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000; margin:12px 0 0 0;"><strong>Kan jeg fortryde eller returnere?</strong></p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b6b6b; margin:2px 0 0 0;">Du har 14 dages fortrydelsesret efter forbrugeraftaleloven. Skriv til <a href="mailto:{{ shop.email }}" style="color:#dd1d1d;">{{ shop.email }}</a>, så får du returinstruktioner — kontakt os altid, inden du sender noget.</p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000; margin:12px 0 0 0;"><strong>Jeg vil ændre noget i min ordre</strong></p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b6b6b; margin:2px 0 0 0;">Skriv til <a href="mailto:{{ shop.email }}" style="color:#dd1d1d;">{{ shop.email }}</a> hurtigst muligt — inden ordren er pakket kan vi som regel nå at ordne det.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Nyhetsbrevs-block -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px 32px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#000000;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding:24px 20px;">
                    <p style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:20px; color:#ffffff; margin:0; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">10 % rabat på næste køb</p>
                    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#d9d9d9; margin:8px 0 16px 0;">Tilmeld dig nyhedsbrevet og få en rabatkode direkte i indbakken. Ingen ventetid.</p>
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td align="center" bgcolor="#dd1d1d" style="background-color:#dd1d1d;">
                          <a href="{{ shop.url }}/#newsletter-footer" target="_blank"
                             style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 32px; font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; text-transform:uppercase;">
                            Hent rabatkoden
                          </a>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Sidfot -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="background-color:#000000; padding:24px 32px; border-top:1px solid #2a2a2a;">
              <p style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#ffffff; margin:0 0 8px 0; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px;">{{ shop.name }}</p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#d9d9d9; margin:0;">
                Spørgsmål til din ordre? Svar på denne mail, eller skriv til
                <a href="mailto:{{ shop.email }}" style="color:#ffffff;">{{ shop.email }}</a>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
